[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: MIL-STD-498 IRS (Interface Requirements Specification)

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: IRS-001
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: User Interface Requirements
STATEMENT: The system shall provide a web-based user interface accessible via standard web browsers (Chrome, Firefox, Safari, Edge) with responsive design for desktop and mobile devices.
RATIONALE: Web-based interface ensures broad accessibility and reduces client installation requirements.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: IRS-002
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: API Interface
STATEMENT: The system shall provide RESTful API endpoints for external system integration with JSON data format and standard HTTP status codes.
RATIONALE: RESTful API enables system integration and third-party application development.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: IRS-003
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Database Interface
STATEMENT: The system shall interface with PostgreSQL database using secure connection protocols and support concurrent user access with transaction management.
RATIONALE: Database interface ensures data persistence and integrity for system operations.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: IRS-004
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Authentication Interface
STATEMENT: The system shall integrate with LDAP/Active Directory for user authentication and support multi-factor authentication (MFA) for enhanced security.
RATIONALE: Authentication interface ensures secure access control and user management.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: IRS-005
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: External System Integration
STATEMENT: The system shall provide interfaces for integration with satellite communication systems, monitoring tools, and reporting systems via standardized protocols.
RATIONALE: External system integration enables comprehensive system monitoring and data exchange.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: IRS-006
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Data Export Interface
STATEMENT: The system shall support data export in multiple formats (CSV, JSON, XML) with configurable data fields and filtering options.
RATIONALE: Data export interface enables reporting and data analysis capabilities.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: IRS-007
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Notification Interface
STATEMENT: The system shall provide email and SMS notification interfaces for system alerts, status updates, and user communications.
RATIONALE: Notification interface ensures timely communication of important system events.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: IRS-008
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Logging Interface
STATEMENT: The system shall provide comprehensive logging interfaces for system events, user actions, and error tracking with configurable log levels.
RATIONALE: Logging interface enables system monitoring, debugging, and audit trail maintenance.
